1
00:01:02,140 --> 00:01:05,980
=The Cruel Tribunal=
=Episode 19=

2
00:02:02,080 --> 00:02:03,520
This wedding dress...

3
00:02:03,840 --> 00:02:05,160
This wedding dress

4
00:02:06,440 --> 00:02:08,280
was meant to be yours.

5
00:02:16,600 --> 00:02:17,800
Songpiao,

6
00:02:18,440 --> 00:02:20,320
could you take me away?

7
00:02:25,240 --> 00:02:26,520
I'm sorry.

8
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:31,040
I can't.

9
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:09,600
Then I'll give you my most

10
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:12,480
precious possession.

11
00:04:26,800 --> 00:04:28,480
Depart.

12
00:04:28,640 --> 00:04:31,080
Welcome the bride.

13
00:06:20,640 --> 00:06:22,240
I, Sizhou,

14
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:24,600
together with my bride, Lady Luan,

15
00:06:26,760 --> 00:06:28,720
pay our respects

16
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:30,440
to Your Highness.

17
00:06:32,200 --> 00:06:33,600
May the bride conduct herself well,

18
00:06:33,800 --> 00:06:35,240
and diligently fulfill her duties.

19
00:06:39,760 --> 00:06:42,240
Serve the ceremonial wedding feast.

20
00:06:46,880 --> 00:06:48,320
Share this ceremonial meal

21
00:06:48,480 --> 00:06:50,760
and may your union last a hundred years.

22
00:06:58,280 --> 00:07:00,000
The shared meal ceremony is complete.

23
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:02,720
May your union prosper for generations.

24
00:07:06,080 --> 00:07:08,240
Raise the cups for the wedding wine

25
00:07:08,240 --> 00:07:10,120
to seal your lifelong bond.

26
00:07:13,760 --> 00:07:15,600
Please raise your cups.

27
00:07:18,160 --> 00:07:18,960
The first toast,

28
00:07:18,960 --> 00:07:20,960
may Heaven and Earth be in harmony.

29
00:07:22,200 --> 00:07:23,280
The second toast,

30
00:07:23,280 --> 00:07:25,480
may the sun and moon shine together.

31
00:07:28,640 --> 00:07:30,480
The auspicious hour has arrived.

32
00:07:30,720 --> 00:07:33,520
Please perform
the hair-binding ceremony.

33
00:07:42,320 --> 00:07:43,600
Sizhou,

34
00:07:47,920 --> 00:07:49,680
I'd like to say

35
00:07:49,760 --> 00:07:50,760
a few words to Songpiao.

36
00:07:53,560 --> 00:07:54,320
Go ahead.

37
00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:27,720
Rousang.

38
00:08:28,240 --> 00:08:29,440
Songpiao,

39
00:08:30,600 --> 00:08:32,120
you're luckier than I am.

40
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:35,120
Because our story

41
00:08:35,920 --> 00:08:37,880
began because of you,

42
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:41,320
while all I can do
is wait for you within that story.

43
00:08:41,960 --> 00:08:42,320
Rousang.

44
00:08:42,320 --> 00:08:43,560
Please let me finish.

45
00:08:46,960 --> 00:08:48,000
My fate

46
00:08:49,560 --> 00:08:50,960
can only end this way.

47
00:08:53,440 --> 00:08:54,960
There's no way to change it.

48
00:08:57,600 --> 00:08:59,080
Everything I wanted to say

49
00:08:59,520 --> 00:09:01,240
is inside that conch shell.

50
00:09:01,800 --> 00:09:02,800
Today,

51
00:09:04,760 --> 00:09:06,160
I'm giving it back to you.

52
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:12,160
Rousang.

53
00:09:12,440 --> 00:09:12,720
You...

54
00:09:13,760 --> 00:09:14,440
Rousang!

55
00:09:14,760 --> 00:09:15,280
Rousang!

56
00:09:19,520 --> 00:09:20,720
Songpiao,

57
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:25,200
if there is a next life,

58
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:28,800
I'll still wait for you.

59
00:09:30,880 --> 00:09:31,920
Because you

60
00:09:34,040 --> 00:09:35,560
are worth loving.

61
00:09:58,080 --> 00:09:59,040
Rousang!

62
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:00,480
Sang!

63
00:10:02,800 --> 00:10:04,000
Rousang!

64
00:10:05,360 --> 00:10:06,160
Sang!

65
00:10:06,320 --> 00:10:07,480
Rousang!

66
00:10:10,960 --> 00:10:11,760
Sang!

67
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:18,960
Get out!

68
00:10:24,920 --> 00:10:25,600
Rousang.

69
00:10:28,720 --> 00:10:29,920
I'll take you back.

70
00:10:36,850 --> 00:10:38,460
♪Frost chills the courtyard♪

71
00:10:38,480 --> 00:10:39,640
Let's go home.

72
00:10:40,260 --> 00:10:42,600
♪The lamp burns out,
leaving two shadows side by side♪

73
00:10:43,250 --> 00:10:46,200
♪On the eve of parting, we still
face each other through the brief night♪

74
00:10:46,690 --> 00:10:47,830
♪As it slowly lengthens♪

75
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:52,810
♪Before we're old,
our hair has turned white♪

76
00:10:54,080 --> 00:10:54,880
You...

77
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:56,920
Guards!

78
00:10:56,960 --> 00:10:58,620
♪A moment
of warmth lingers at our fingertips♪

79
00:10:58,770 --> 00:11:01,750
♪I dare not hold on,
for fear it will end in sorrow♪

80
00:11:02,880 --> 00:11:04,480
Anyone who dares stop me today

81
00:11:06,310 --> 00:11:07,160
will die.

82
00:11:07,180 --> 00:11:08,730
♪Life has grown cold♪

83
00:11:10,960 --> 00:11:12,360
All of you, stand down!

84
00:11:13,770 --> 00:11:17,870
♪Deep within♪

85
00:11:18,470 --> 00:11:21,350
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

86
00:11:21,870 --> 00:11:24,950
♪Why leave me
standing alone in the wind?♪

87
00:11:25,390 --> 00:11:27,990
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

88
00:11:27,990 --> 00:11:32,030
♪Yet all that's left
is warmth upon my fingertips♪

89
00:11:32,170 --> 00:11:35,310
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

90
00:11:35,510 --> 00:11:38,100
♪And write
of every meeting and every parting♪

91
00:11:38,120 --> 00:11:40,860
♪If next life asks
about the days gone by♪

92
00:11:41,120 --> 00:11:44,460
♪I'll only say that once♪

93
00:11:44,600 --> 00:11:48,440
♪I called your name♪

94
00:11:55,060 --> 00:11:57,660
♪The candle
burns down to its final glow♪

95
00:11:58,620 --> 00:12:01,020
♪Cold fragrance clings to my hem♪

96
00:12:01,660 --> 00:12:03,420
♪You gently smooth my hair♪

97
00:12:03,420 --> 00:12:06,340
♪Yet your gaze drifts far away♪

98
00:12:08,780 --> 00:12:11,220
♪A hidden blade lies beneath your smile♪

99
00:12:11,580 --> 00:12:14,900
♪You turn away
as if nothing has changed♪

100
00:12:15,500 --> 00:12:17,060
♪Step by step, I walk away♪

101
00:12:17,220 --> 00:12:20,540
♪Each step breaks my heart anew♪

102
00:12:23,300 --> 00:12:26,180
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

103
00:12:26,700 --> 00:12:29,780
♪Why leave me
standing alone in the wind?♪

104
00:12:30,220 --> 00:12:32,820
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

105
00:12:32,820 --> 00:12:36,860
♪Yet all that's left
is warmth upon my fingertips♪

106
00:12:37,100 --> 00:12:40,140
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

107
00:12:40,540 --> 00:12:43,220
♪And write
of every meeting and every parting♪

108
00:12:43,220 --> 00:12:45,940
♪If next life asks
about the days gone by♪

109
00:12:46,220 --> 00:12:49,180
♪I'll only say that once♪

110
00:12:49,660 --> 00:12:51,420
♪I called your name♪

111
00:12:56,020 --> 00:12:58,260
♪The silent stars hang low♪

112
00:12:59,660 --> 00:13:01,860
♪The river keeps flowing east♪

113
00:13:03,100 --> 00:13:05,020
♪I linger in the old tower♪

114
00:13:05,140 --> 00:13:08,780
♪Waiting for you,
though all is now empty♪

115
00:13:10,100 --> 00:13:12,540
♪This life still owes us a bow♪

116
00:13:13,420 --> 00:13:16,220
♪May the next repay us with a dream♪

117
00:13:16,980 --> 00:13:19,220
♪Beyond here lie
endless mountains and rivers♪

118
00:13:19,220 --> 00:13:25,460
♪I dare not turn for one last look♪

119
00:13:25,740 --> 00:13:28,620
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

120
00:13:29,220 --> 00:13:32,700
♪Why bury this heart beneath the frost?♪

121
00:13:32,700 --> 00:13:35,340
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

122
00:13:35,340 --> 00:13:39,620
♪Now only
fading warmth remains in my palm♪

123
00:13:39,620 --> 00:13:42,540
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

124
00:13:42,980 --> 00:13:45,700
♪And paint a winter between your brows♪

125
00:13:45,700 --> 00:13:48,380
♪If we meet again in another life♪

126
00:13:48,700 --> 00:13:51,420
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

127
00:13:52,100 --> 00:13:54,380
♪Was when we first met?♪

128
00:13:55,660 --> 00:13:58,060
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

129
00:13:59,180 --> 00:14:00,940
♪Was when we met for the last time?♪
